# Wait for the satellite to enter the Earth's shadow
# Waits until the orbit the run follows puts the satellite in umbra, for at most
# the minutes given. It ends at once if the satellite is in umbra already. Choose
# the orbit first, with orbit follow or orbit replay.
block eclipse within <minutes:number 1..600 min>
load rOrbit

until InUmbra = true within {minutes} min
